  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Gen &amp; Claire Co. is an online shop filled with unique and expressive graphic tees and other giftable goods, worthy of your besties! Uplifting and Inspirational, all with a touch of light-hearted humor. We celebrate those who work on self-development, even when it looks a bit like fumbling forward.&nbsp; We even have a category dedicated to True Crime themed products because every friend group has at least one fan!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>We provide our customers with unique tees and other goods that feature custom graphics designed in-house... no mass-produced graphics! We also have a growing variety of digital products. Customers have a wide variety of payment options to make shopping convenient. We offer $5 flat rate US shipping, and orders over $75 get free US standard shipping. Our stickers ship free in the US.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our affiliates earn 10% on all orders and an <strong><em>extra 20% </em></strong>on all digital items! <br>I will also create a one-time 15% off discount code for you to offer your referrals, if you like.</p>",
